        "title": "Finding an equation",
        "text": "$$\\frac{2x}{4x^2+\\frac{1}{4}}=1=\\frac{1}{1}$$ if and only if $$2x=4x^2+\\frac{1}{4}$$",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "",
        "license": ""
    },
